    "text": "By Bob Norris ,\n1 days ago The Germantown Police Department is turning the page on an era as one of its most seasoned officers, Captain Jodi Whitfield, prepares for retirement. After a commendable tenure of 33 years, Whitfield's departure was announced in a social media post by the department, heralding the end of a storied career. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
